{
  "about": "Pages in Search Console's top 200 (28 days, by clicks) in any metrics_snapshot row in D1, each with its highest clicks and impressions. seo_pages.earning_paths never makes one of these noindex when it has a click or SEARCH_KEEP_IMPRESSIONS impressions. To refresh, run the query below on the internscout D1 database (read only) and replace pages with its rows.",
  "query": "SELECT json_extract(p.value,'$.path') AS pg, max(json_extract(p.value,'$.clicks')) AS clicks, max(json_extract(p.value,'$.impressions')) AS impressions FROM metrics_snapshot s, json_each(json_extract(s.data,'$.search_console.pages')) p GROUP BY pg ORDER BY pg",
